Question: Did Sorrento Therapeutics break the law by not posting results for its terminated COVID-19 trials?

Snapshot date: 2026-11-05
Research notes: The Lead hit its lookup cap and planned from what it had found.; researcher:disclosures hit its 8-turn cap and reported from what it had found.; researcher:disclosures hit its 8-turn cap and reported from what it had found.

Findings:
[{"lane": "trials", "round": 1, "brief": "Analyze the registry facts for Sorrento Therapeutics' COVID-19 trials, specifically NCT04903327 and NCT04900428. Determine their overall status, why they were stopped, key dates (start date, primary completion, completion date), whether results are posted, and any calculated lateness based on due dates.", "findings": [{"claim": "Trial NCT04903327 (Study of Intravenous COVI-MSC for Treatment of COVID-19-Induced Acute Respiratory Distress) has an overall status of TERMINATED, was started on 2021-11-16, with primary completion date 2022-08-29 and completion date 2022-11-23, and enrolled 43 patients.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed live record matches snapshot."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04903327 was stopped because: \"Due to considerably slow enrollment, unable to reach enrollment targets\", categorized under enrollment.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Exact quote from registry why_stopped field."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04903327 has no results posted on ClinicalTrials.gov (results_posted is false, results_first_post_date is null). The results due date was 2023-08-29, making it 1164 days late.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Calculated days late based on primary completion date plus 365 days."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04900428 (Study to Evaluate a Single Intranasal Dose of STI-2099 (COVI-DROPS) in Outpatient Adults With COVID-19 (UK)) has an overall status of TERMINATED, was started on 2021-07-16, with primary completion date 2022-03-22 and completion date 2022-05-06, and enrolled 179 patients.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04900428"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed live record matches snapshot."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04900428 was stopped because: \"Study was terminated at interim analysis due to drops not working on new variants\", categorized under efficacy.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04900428"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Exact quote from registry why_stopped field."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04900428 has no results posted on ClinicalTrials.gov (results_posted is false, results_first_post_date is null). The results due date was 2023-03-22, making it 1324 days late.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04900428"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Calculated days late based on primary completion date plus 365 days."}], "gaps": []}, {"lane": "disclosures", "round": 1, "brief": "Review the SEC filings associated with Sorrento Therapeutics' trials NCT04903327 and NCT04900428. Identify what the company told investors in their 8-K or other reports near the stoppage dates, focusing on the stated reasons for halting the trials and whether they match the registry reasons.", "findings": [{"claim": "For trial NCT04903327 (Study of Intravenous COVI-MSC for Treatment of COVID-19-Induced Acute Respiratory Distress), get_trial_filings returned relevant 8-K filings from Sorrento Therapeutics, Inc. (CIK 0000850261) mentioning trademarks and pipeline descriptions, but did not mention the trial stoppage.", "evidence_ids": ["sec:0001104659-23-023902", "sec:0001104659-23-034065", "sec:0001104659-23-039478"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Filings mention COVI-MSC as a trademark or in pipeline lists without discussing trial termination or discontinuation."}, {"claim": "For trial NCT04900428, get_trial_filings stated: 'No 8-K found from 2021-11-22 to 2022-09-03 and 2022-10-02 to 2023-05-30 for CIK 0000850261 (Sorrento Therapeutics, Inc.) naming NCT04900428, COVI-DROPS.'", "evidence_ids": ["sec:none:nct04900428-0000850261"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "No matching 8-K found mentioning this trial or drug in the specified windows."}, {"claim": "According to the trials registry database, NCT04903327 was terminated with the reason: 'Due to considerably slow enrollment, unable to reach enrollment targets.'", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Registry reason for NCT04903327 is enrollment."}, {"claim": "According to the trials registry database, NCT04900428 was terminated with the reason: 'Study was terminated at interim analysis due to drops not working on new variants.'", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04900428"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Registry reason for NCT04900428 is efficacy."}, {"claim": "The find_discrepancies tool reported: 'Discrepancies table: 0 trials labelled discrepancy for sponsor Sorrento, nct_id NCT04903327 (0 checked by hand).'", "evidence_ids": ["snapshot:discrepancies:labels-discrepancy-nct-id-nct04903327-sponsor-sorrento"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "No pre-compiled discrepancy label for NCT04903327."}, {"claim": "The find_discrepancies tool reported: 'Discrepancies table: 0 trials labelled discrepancy for sponsor Sorrento, nct_id NCT04900428 (0 checked by hand).'", "evidence_ids": ["snapshot:discrepancies:labels-discrepancy-nct-id-nct04900428-sponsor-sorrento"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "No pre-compiled discrepancy label for NCT04900428."}], "gaps": []}, {"lane": "publications", "round": 1, "brief": "Examine the publication history for Sorrento Therapeutics' trials NCT04903327 and NCT04900428. Check the linked PubMed and Europe PMC articles, including publication dates, to see if and how the results or the termination of these trials were communicated to the scientific community.", "findings": [{"claim": "No results publication found for Sorrento Therapeutics' trial NCT04903327; 5 articles were found in Europe PMC/PubMed that only mention the trial or predate it.", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:none:nct04903327", "pubmed:34831101", "pubmed:35321737", "pubmed:35782071", "pubmed:35897770", "pubmed:38005826"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Snapshot only, not checked live. Five mention-only articles exist (PMIDs 34831101, 35321737, 35782071, 35897770, 38005826)."}, {"claim": "For Sorrento Therapeutics' trial NCT04900428, one results candidate was found (PMID 34473343, Cochrane Database of Systematic Reviews, published 2021-09-02), but abstract review indicates it is a living systematic review tracking multiple trials rather than a primary trial results report specifically explaining why NCT04900428 was terminated.", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:34473343"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Snapshot only, not checked live. PMID 34473343 lists NCT04900428 in its nct_ids list, but abstract is a systematic review of SARS-CoV-2 neutralizing monoclonal antibodies."}], "gaps": []}, {"lane": "disclosures", "round": 2, "brief": "Search Sorrento Therapeutics (CIK 0000850261) 10-K and 10-Q filings from 2022 and 2023. Look for mentions of NCT04903327, NCT04900428, COVI-MSC, COVI-DROPS, or STI-2099 to find disclosures on trial progress, terminations, or clinical results.\n\n(Gap to close: Sponsor Sorrento Therapeutics matched to CIK 0000850261 but search was limited to 8-Ks. We need to review annual and quarterly reports for trial details.)", "findings": [{"claim": "No paragraph in the 2021 10-K or 2022 10-K mentions NCT04903327 or NCT04900428.", "evidence_ids": ["sec:0000950170-22-003472", "sec:0000950170-23-008238"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Checked via get_filing_excerpt for both annual reports."}, {"claim": "In the 2021 10-K, Sorrento Therapeutics stated: \"Phase II studies of COVIDROPS in outpatients with COVID-19 have begun enrollment in Mexico, the United Kingdom and the U.S. The United Kingdom study reached the planned interim analysis threshold in the\"", "evidence_ids": ["sec:0000950170-22-003472"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Names the drug COVIDROPS (STI-2099) but gives no reason for trial discontinuation."}, {"claim": "In the 2022 10-K, Sorrento Therapeutics stated: \"We expect these losses to increase as we: (i) advance RTX, STI-6129 (anti-CD38 ADC), STI-1492 (anti-CD38 DAR-T), STI-6643 (anti-CD47 antibody), SP-103, SEMDEXA TM and our other product candidates, including our COVID-19-related product candidates, STI-2099 (COVIDROPS), STI-9167 (COVISHIELD), STI-1558 (SARS-CoV-2 Oral Mpro inhibitor), and STI-8282 (COVI-MSC), into further clinical trials\"", "evidence_ids": ["sec:0000950170-23-008238"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Names the drugs COVI-DROPS and COVI-MSC in pipeline development context, gives no reason."}, {"claim": "In the Q1 2022 10-Q, Sorrento Therapeutics stated: \"advance RTX, STI-6129 (anti-CD38 ADC), STI-1492 (anti-CD38 DAR-T), STI-6643 (anti-CD47 antibody), SP-103, SEMDEXATM and our other product candidates, including our COVID-19 related product candidates, STI-2099 (COVIDROPS), STI-9167 (COVISHIELD), STI-8282 (COVI-MSC) and STI-5656 (Abivertinib), into further clinical trials\"", "evidence_ids": ["sec:0000950170-22-007887"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Mentions candidates and gives no reason."}, {"claim": "In the Q2 2022 10-Q, Sorrento Therapeutics stated: \"advance RTX, STI-6129 (anti-CD38 ADC), STI-1492 (anti-CD38 DAR-T), STI-6643 (anti-CD47 antibody), SP-103, SEMDEXATM and our other product candidates, including our COVID-19 related product candidates, STI-2099 (COVIDROPS), STI-9167 (COVISHIELD), STI-8282 (COVI-MSC) and STI-5656 (Abivertinib), into further clinical trials\"", "evidence_ids": ["sec:0000950170-22-017437"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Mentions candidates and gives no reason."}], "gaps": []}, {"lane": "publications", "round": 2, "brief": "Search Europe PMC for COVI-MSC, COVI-DROPS, and STI-2099. Check if any articles contain clinical trial results for NCT04903327 or NCT04900428 that were not indexed with the NCT identifiers.\n\n(Gap to close: No primary results publication was found by NCT ID, but results might be published under the drug code names or synonyms.)", "findings": [{"claim": "No results publication found for NCT04903327 (COVI-MSC), with 5 mention-only articles identified in Europe PMC mentioning the trial or drug.", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:none:nct04903327", "pubmed:34831101", "pubmed:35321737", "pubmed:35782071", "pubmed:35897770", "pubmed:38005826"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Snapshot only, not checked live."}, {"claim": "For NCT04900428 (COVI-DROPS / STI-2099), searching Europe PMC using the drug names COVI-DROPS and STI-2099 linked to PMID 34473343 (a Cochrane systematic review by Siemieniuk et al., 2021). Review of the abstract confirms this is a systematic review of SARS-CoV-2 neutralizing monoclonal antibodies, mentioning NCT04900428 in its extensive study registry list, but it does not report primary trial results for NCT04900428.", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:34473343"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Snapshot only, not checked live."}], "gaps": []}]

